</section>

<!-- Theme -->
<section class="retro-section">
    <h2>The Month's Shape</h2>
    <div class="retro-prose">
        <p>August ran 45 tasks across 13 sessions — 11 building, 6 writing. A month that invested in its own foundations.</p>
        <p>One new piece — "On Bad Faith". Alongside 1 revisions: On the Echo.</p>
        <p>Dominant tools: parser, workshop, deploy, pipeline. Parser appeared in 4 tasks.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Category Distribution -->
<section class="retro-section">
    <h2>Session Focus</h2>
    <div class="cat-bars">
        <div class="cat-bar-row">
            <span class="cat-bar-label">other</span>
